{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I have always had a problem of forgetting which git branch I was on and committing my changes to the wrong branch.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/de457fdcb3ea350584b5eca594fee5eecc736b6591d2df7b79274389be186ea5.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.32, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.34], [7, 1.34, 1.76], [8, 1.76, 2.16], [10, 2.4, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.96], [12, 2.96, 3.16], [13, 3.16, 3.4], [14, 3.4, 3.62], [15, 3.62, 3.96], [16, 3.96, 4.18], [17, 4.18, 4.56], [18, 4.56, 4.8], [19, 4.8, 4.88], [20, 4.88, 5.06], [21, 5.06, 5.42]]}, {"text": "The best way I have found to solve this problem is to have the branch name printed in the console prompt.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c41726ca4aaf366a5b56b8c77ba3acb9367339389a35a4ee3ba90ee0679f56ff.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.54], [5, 0.74, 0.96], [6, 0.96, 1.18], [7, 1.18, 1.38], [8, 1.38, 1.6], [9, 1.6, 1.92], [10, 1.92, 2.16], [11, 2.16, 2.32], [12, 2.32, 2.42], [13, 2.42, 2.58], [14, 2.58, 2.86], [15, 2.86, 3.12], [16, 3.12, 3.46], [17, 3.46, 3.7], [18, 3.7, 3.8], [19, 3.8, 4.12], [20, 4.12, 4.5]]}, {"text": "You can modify the prompt message in OSX by setting the PS1 variable in ~/.bash_profile", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8f60771ecddd180c3bd2e740367904fcc8322092d6436d0fcd5cd74704d642af.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 3.0], [10, 3.0, 3.18], [11, 3.18, 3.76], [12, 3.76, 4.2], [13, 4.2, 4.58]]}, {"text": "First you need to parse the git branch name by using this function", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/779d22d69a0ac0ce2198bc965097068c1e5e868ed82db7d8d8457502b597f04f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.12], [7, 1.3, 1.62], [8, 1.62, 1.92], [9, 1.92, 2.12], [10, 2.12, 2.34], [11, 2.34, 2.64], [12, 2.64, 3.02]]}, {"text": "```console .bash_profile parse_git_branch() { git branch 2> /dev/null | sed -e ‘/^[^]/d’ -e ‘s/ (.*)/ (\\1)/’ }", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cd6e066b4020589595a4994822690c923d9aba8d63f77cf9c2840e481c750196.mp3"}, {"text": "Cheers.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3c356ca8be70b6ecabb54a5e0bad26f62259567f53617569cc8ea6a931b70b12.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3]]}]}